        {
          "id": 2533558322,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "Thanks for the guidance. I've added two more checks. A limit to the message size and also a check on the control word value wich fixes a particular byte to null.\n\nI could further check the control word against all known values if you think it may help.\n\nWould you consider this tight enough or is it still too false positive prone?\n\nThanks!",
