        {
          "id": 2565426283,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "I do not know this protocol and will not spend time truing to figure out if the heuristics could be improved or not. But having an heuristic dissector enabled for a niche protocol does not sounds like a good idea to me, as it will be some extra checks performed for every TCP/UDP pcap you open. Note that !20227 also includes oterh changes I consider as fixes of the current code.",
          "author": {
            "id": 6722527,
            "username": "pquantin",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Pascal Quantin",
            "state": "active",
